  "notes": [
    "carBox: measured on 2x ruler crops of the pack photo (2878x3545): rear bumper x 636, front indicator x 2222, roof y 2822, tyre bottoms y ~3310; segModel birefnet-general as on the other cars",
    "wheels: black tyres on the dark car and smoky blister, so the circles are given: hubs at (1020, 3190) rear and (1980, 3198) front, tyre edges ~x 905-1135 / 1862-2098, r 115",
    "model.glass: the sheet's window finder took the black roof, pillars and roof rails for glass on every view (black paint is as dark as the tinted windows), so every view is replaced by the drawing's window panels traced inside the chrome frames on 2-2.6x ruler crops of the sheet: side/left door + rear quarter windows, front windscreen, rear window, top windscreen, rear window and the side-glass strips. Without it the top drawing was weighted down over the whole roof and Tripo's white reflection blob survived there",
    "model.rebake.glass: only the windscreen gets glass (front traced on one half and mirrored, top traced whole), inside the chrome frame of Tripo's own windscreen panel (tripo-sheet/tripo-clay ruler crops). Tripo left the door and quarter windows and the rear window as open holes (the clay shows the seats and mirror through them), so side, left and rear are left out and the top view's rear window is not traced: there is nothing to paint",
    "model.rebake.skip side, a band around the right rear wheel (centre 266,283, r 50-100 sheet px, kept below the chrome strip at y 207): the sheet draws a wider flared arch with white highlight crescents at y 220-245; Tripo's arch hugs the tyre, so the drawing's flare and highlights landed on the mesh's fender as grey streaks (side/close-up renders). Tripo's own plain black paint is kept there"
  ],
